  "description": "Advanced text diff library with Myers algorithm, supporting line-level, character-level, and word-level differences with multiple output formats (Excel DTO, JSON, Unified Diff, HTML). Configurable detail levels (None/Character/Word) for granular change detection. Ideal for comparing stored procedures, SQL scripts, or any text files.",
