  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.2 - Added word-level diff support with DetailLevel enum (None/Character/Word). Tokenizes words, whitespace, and punctuation separately. Replaced EnableCharacterLevelDiff with DetailLevel property for better extensibility. HTML formatter now highlights character and word changes with darker colors. Fully backward compatible via DI.",
